  "Header": "MMC-MTS-V2.5",
  "APIProfile": "Basic",
  "Description": "Multimodal Translation Service: the HCI Module for spoken translation with a Portable Avatar. Automatic Speech Recognition recognises the human's speech into text; Text-to-Text Translation translates it into the language named by the Language Selector; Response and Scene Rendering speaks the translation and produces the lip-synced Machine Face Descriptors in the target language. The translated text is also exposed. Non-affective; no Personal Status is supplied. Acquisition and delivery are the User Agent, not sub-AIMs.",
